      },
      "text": "Network Infrastructure C2 server on port 443 Targets Aerospace industry in the United States Context The BlackBerry Threat Research and Intelligence team recently uncovered two campaigns by a previously unknown threat actor, which we have named AeroBlade, targeting an aerospace industry company in the U.S.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
