        "sentence_id": "p3_s1"
      },
      "text": "Attack Vector First Stage The first stage of the infection is a targeted email that has a malicious document attachment with the filename [redacted].docx.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
